xt":"{\"approval_id\":\"appr_8\",\"total_cost_usd_micros\":1760000,\"max_cost_usd_micros\":1760000,\"next\":\"Present this plan to the user and wait for their reply. Do not execute until they approve.\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_011GHiZS4hs4Ln7rZvgs3cq8","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_prepare_route","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":23,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've got a route ready to move 0.1 ETH from your mainnet wallet into about 299.70 USDC on Base, but nothing has been sent yet. It needs your approval first.\n\n| # | Leg | In | Out (quoted) | Cost |\n|---|-----|----|--------------|------|\n| 1 | Bridge ETH from mainnet (`eth1`) to Base (`base1`) | 0.10021 ETH | 0.1000433 ETH | $1.40 |\n| 2 | Swap ETH to USDC on Base | 0.1 ETH | 299.70 USDC | $0.36 |\n\n- **Total cost:** $1.76. Your limit is $8.00, so this is well under it.\n- **Why it bridges a bit more than 0.1 ETH:** your Base wallet has no ETH right now. The extra 0.00021 ETH covers the bridge fee and the gas for the swap on Base. It also leaves 0.0000233 ETH there, enough for one more transaction later.\n- **Why this route:** the other option was to swap on mainnet and then bridge the USDC. That costs $5.30, gives you 296.5 USDC, and leaves your Base wallet with no ETH to pay for its next transaction.\n- **Ending balances:**\n  - Mainnet wallet: about 0.0498 ETH, less a small gas fee.\n  - Base wallet: about 299.70 USDC plus about 0.0000233 ETH.\n- **Timing:** the bridge takes about 60 seconds and the swap about 2 seconds.\n\nThe quotes expire about 5 minutes after they were issued; if they lapse, I'll get new ones. Should I go ahead, or do you want to set a cost cap?"}]},{"role":"user","sequence":24,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":25,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_7","approval_id":"appr_8"},"id":"toolu_01F88YGWB6HJF1jcFbQW8FLd"}]},{"role":"